  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Asia Regional Infrastructure Connectivity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SARIC aims to increase private sector and Multilateral Development Bank (MDB) lending for, and quality of transport and energy projects in South Asia. SARIC has three components: i) MDB trust fund support for project preparation and technical  assistance and regional infrastructure sector analysis and planning; ii) a partnership with an Australian institution to make Australian expertise available throughout the region in engineering, construction, finance, public policy and law, and iii} investment in innovative mechanisms to unlock additional private capital in South Asian Connectivity infrastructure, including from developed country institutional investors.</narrative>
  </description>
